  "codex_last_message": "Changed the experimental ANN branch in [src/db.rs](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/src/db.rs:40) to add `VDB_COARSE_PRESCORE_MODE=residual`, so the compact shortlist can use centroid-relative residual dims instead of raw selected dims. I also wired `--coarse-prescore-mode` through the local/exact ANN harness in [measure_ann_search_only](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/tools/measure_ann_search_only:69), [measure_ann_benchmark](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/tools/measure_ann_benchmark:37), the sweep helpers, and documented the cycle in [campaign_journal.md](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/campaign_journal.md:426), [research_notes.md](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/research_notes.md:346), [strategy.md](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/strategy.md:10), and [cycle_049.json](/__modal/volumes/vo-WauxZXgTehLrBgTwgcOh2J/campaign/workspace/.meta_codex/recent_cycles/cycle_049.json:1).\n\nResults: residual coarse is better than the parked raw coarse branch, but still not promotion-grade. Best local point was cluster-scope residual `32 / 2048` at about `4716.29 QPS`, `0.9367` recall; primary-scope residual `32 / 2048` hit about `4766.76`, `0.9333`. I did not pay the exact ANN gate because the local ceiling was already too low. The kept official state is valid: `build_project` succeeded, `run_correctness_test` passed at `1.0000`, and a fresh quick `run_benchmark` reached `12750.38 QPS`.\n\nCurrent expectation is still roughly low-`12k` to low-`13k` quick on the default scored path and mid-`5k` exact on the kept flat ANN branch. The next best move is not another narrow coarse budget sweep; it is either a materially cheaper coarse selector or a stronger residual-aware shortlist stage, most likely shared secondary-residual codebooks or another routing layer that actually cuts scanned vectors before the `~400+ us` selector cost dominates.",
